# ==========================================
# Mosquitto Access Control List (ACL)
# Digital Twin Corridor Telemetry Transport
# ==========================================

# Backend consumer: read access to observation and corridor topics
user twin_service
topic read corridor/#
topic read nagartwin/#
topic readwrite $SYS/#

# Telemetry ingestion clients: write access restricted to observation topics
user twin_ingest
topic write corridor/+/observations
topic write nagartwin/+/+/+/+
